text_output=So that's the typical calendar, initial budgets, board reviews, talk about growth, talk about opportunity, final budgets. We're working through that. Look, Anna, CPM, there is just for clarity, there is no broad-based CPM that's going to cut across every SPE group with a prescriptive way of doing it. We're not doing that.
